//@version=6
// =====================================================================================================
// COMBINED ROLE-BASED STRATEGY  (Pine Script v6)
// Ported from local sources in source_indicators/: Nadaraya-Watson Trend.pine, Lorentzian Classification.pine,
// WaveTrend Oscillator.pine, Weis Wave Volume.pine, Squeeze Momentum.pine
// =====================================================================================================
// CREDITS: this strategy re-implements logic from five open-source TradingView indicators. Full
// citations, licences and the unmodified original code are in the header of each local source file.
//  1) Machine Learning: Lorentzian Classification, by jdehorty (https://www.tradingview.com/u/jdehorty/)
//     https://www.tradingview.com/script/WhBzgfDu-Machine-Learning-Lorentzian-Classification/
//     Mozilla Public License 2.0, (c) jdehorty. Also uses jdehorty's MLExtensions and KernelFunctions libraries.
//  2) Nadaraya-Watson Trend [QuantAlgo], by QuantAlgo (https://www.tradingview.com/u/QuantAlgo/)
//     https://www.tradingview.com/script/DyPTog1C-Nadaraya-Watson-Trend-QuantAlgo/
//     CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/), (c) QuantAlgo
//  3) Indicator: WaveTrend Oscillator [WT], by LazyBear (https://www.tradingview.com/u/LazyBear/)
//     https://www.tradingview.com/script/2KE8wTuF-Indicator-WaveTrend-Oscillator-WT/
//  4) Weis Wave Volume, by modhelius (https://www.tradingview.com/u/modhelius/)
//     https://www.tradingview.com/script/QrCFs0K2-Weis-Wave-Volume/
//  5) Squeeze Momentum Indicator [LazyBear], by LazyBear (https://www.tradingview.com/u/LazyBear/)
//     https://www.tradingview.com/script/nqQ1DT5a-Squeeze-Momentum-Indicator-LazyBear/
// =====================================================================================================
// ROLE ASSIGNMENTS (each indicator is used ONLY in its role)
//  1) Nadaraya-Watson Trend (QuantAlgo) ........ TREND  - directional bias filter only
//     - Causal ENDPOINT estimator only: NW(t) = sum(w(i) * src[t-i]) / sum(w(i)), i = 0..lookback.
//       Only current and past bars are used. The source script has no non-causal (two-sided /
//       centered) mode; none is ported. Residual bands, gradient, markers are not used.
//     - Presets removed (hardcoded values); set Lookback/Bandwidth/Multiplier manually instead
//       (Fast Response = 25/5/1.5, Smooth Trend = 100/12/2.5).
//     - trendLong  = NW(t) > NW(t-k)   [+ optional: source > NW]
//     - trendShort = NW(t) < NW(t-k)   [+ optional: source < NW]
//  2) Lorentzian Classification (jdehorty) ...... ENTRY  - the ONLY source of entry signals
//     - Approximate-nearest-neighbour Lorentzian KNN, features, label logic and the LC-internal
//       prediction filters (volatility / regime / ADX) are ported as in the source.
//     - LC's own kernel-regression filter and EMA/SMA filters are REMOVED: the trend role belongs
//       exclusively to Nadaraya-Watson.
//     - entryLong  = LC signal flipped to LONG within the last N bars, is still LONG, and that flip
//       has not already produced a trade. entryShort mirrored.
//  3) WaveTrend (LazyBear) ...................... TIMING - valid entry window
//     - timingLong  = WT1 < overbought cap  AND (mode) WT1 crossed above WT2 within N bars and WT1 > WT2
//     - timingShort = WT1 > oversold cap    AND (mode) WT1 crossed below WT2 within N bars and WT1 < WT2
//  4) Weis Wave Volume .......................... CONFIRMATION - wave must agree with direction
//     - confirmLong  = current Weis wave direction is UP   [+ optional: wave volume >= avg * mult]
//     - confirmShort = current Weis wave direction is DOWN [+ optional: wave volume >= avg * mult]
//  5) Squeeze Momentum (LazyBear) ............... REGIME GATE - non-directional
//     - regimeGate = 'Squeeze Off' | 'Not In Squeeze' | 'Released Within Window'
//                    [+ optional: |momentum| expanding, no sign used]
//
// ENTRY RULES (evaluated on confirmed bars only)
//  LONG  = barConfirmed AND allowLongs  AND regimeGate AND trendLong  AND entryLong  AND timingLong  AND confirmLong
//  SHORT = barConfirmed AND allowShorts AND regimeGate AND trendShort AND entryShort AND timingShort AND confirmShort
//  An opposite combined entry reverses the open position.
//
// EXIT RULES
//  - Exit Mode (derived from the LC entry-signal source only):
//      'LC Signal Flip'      : close LONG on a new LC SHORT signal (SHORT mirrored)
//      'LC Fixed Hold'       : close after N bars counted from the entry-signal bar (LC training horizon)
//      'Either (LC Default)' : whichever comes first (mirrors LC's default strict 4-bar exit + early flip)
//  - Optional ATR stop-loss / take-profit (risk management, not an indicator role). Levels are
//    fixed from the signal-bar close and ATR and do not move afterwards.
//
// EXECUTION / REPAINTING NOTES
//  - process_orders_on_close = false: signals are computed on the confirmed bar close and orders fill
//    at the NEXT bar open, so no fill occurs at a price that was already known when the signal formed.
//  - calc_on_every_tick = false and all signals are gated by barstate.isconfirmed.
//  - No request.security calls are used (no higher-timeframe data, no lookahead).
//  - Weis Wave Volume 'timeframe' parameter from the indicator() call is not ported (chart timeframe).
//  - LC anchors its training window on last_bar_index (as in the source). Confirmed signals do not
//    change within a session, but historical signals can shift when the chart is reloaded with more bars.
// =====================================================================================================
strategy('Combined Role-Based Strategy', shorttitle = 'CRB Strategy', overlay = true,
     initial_capital = 10000, currency = currency.NONE,
     default_qty_type = strategy.percent_of_equity, default_qty_value = 10,
     pyramiding = 0, margin_long = 100, margin_short = 100,
     commission_type = strategy.commission.percent, commission_value = 0.075, slippage = 2,
     process_orders_on_close = false, calc_on_every_tick = false, calc_on_order_fills = false,
     max_bars_back = 500)

import jdehorty/MLExtensions/2 as ml

// =====================================================================================================
// INPUT GROUPS
// =====================================================================================================
G_STRAT   = 'Strategy Controls'
G_TREND   = 'Trend | Nadaraya-Watson'
G_ENTRY   = 'Entry | Lorentzian Classification'
G_ENTRY_F = 'Entry | LC Feature Engineering'
G_ENTRY_X = 'Entry | LC Prediction Filters'
G_TIMING  = 'Timing | WaveTrend'
G_CONFIRM = 'Confirmation | Weis Wave Volume'
G_REGIME  = 'Regime Gate | Squeeze Momentum'
G_EXIT    = 'Exits & Risk'

// ---- Strategy controls
allowLongs  = input.bool(true, 'Allow Longs', group = G_STRAT)
allowShorts = input.bool(true, 'Allow Shorts', group = G_STRAT)

// =====================================================================================================
// TREND | NADARAYA-WATSON (causal endpoint estimator only)
// =====================================================================================================
nwSrc              = input.source(close, 'Source', group = G_TREND)
nwKernelType       = input.string('Gaussian', 'Kernel Type', options = ['Gaussian', 'Epanechnikov', 'Triangular', 'Quartic', 'Cosine', 'Rational Quadratic'], group = G_TREND)
nwLookback         = input.int(50, 'Lookback Window', minval = 1, maxval = 500, group = G_TREND)
nwBandwidth        = input.int(8, 'Kernel Bandwidth', minval = 1, group = G_TREND)
nwHMult            = input.float(2.0, 'Bandwidth Multiplier', minval = 0.1, step = 0.1, group = G_TREND)
nwRelWeight        = input.float(8.0, 'Relative Weighting (RQ)', minval = 0.1, step = 0.25, group = G_TREND)
nwSlopeLen         = input.int(1, 'Slope Lookback (bars)', minval = 1, maxval = 50, group = G_TREND)
nwRequirePriceSide = input.bool(false, 'Require Source On Trend Side Of NW Line', group = G_TREND)

nwKernelWeight(float dist, float h, string ktype, float rq) =>
    float w = 0.0
    if h > 0.0
        float u = dist / h
        if ktype == 'Gaussian'
            w := math.exp(-(dist * dist) / (2.0 * h * h))
        else if ktype == 'Rational Quadratic'
            w := math.pow(1.0 + (dist * dist) / (2.0 * rq * h * h), -rq)
        else if math.abs(u) <= 1.0
            if ktype == 'Epanechnikov'
                w := 0.75 * (1.0 - u * u)
            else if ktype == 'Triangular'
                w := 1.0 - math.abs(u)
            else if ktype == 'Quartic'
                w := (15.0 / 16.0) * math.pow(1.0 - u * u, 2.0)
            else if ktype == 'Cosine'
                w := (math.pi / 4.0) * math.cos(math.pi * u / 2.0)
    w

float nwH    = nwBandwidth * nwHMult
float nwSumW = 0.0
float nwSumP = 0.0
for i = 0 to nwLookback
    float w = nwKernelWeight(i, nwH, nwKernelType, nwRelWeight)
    nwSumW += w
    nwSumP += nwSrc[i] * w

float nwTrend = nwSumW != 0.0 ? nwSumP / nwSumW : na

bool nwValid    = not na(nwTrend) and not na(nwTrend[nwSlopeLen])
bool nwSlopeUp  = nwValid and nwTrend > nwTrend[nwSlopeLen]
bool nwSlopeDn  = nwValid and nwTrend < nwTrend[nwSlopeLen]
bool trendLong  = nwSlopeUp and (not nwRequirePriceSide or nwSrc > nwTrend)
bool trendShort = nwSlopeDn and (not nwRequirePriceSide or nwSrc < nwTrend)

// =====================================================================================================
// ENTRY | LORENTZIAN CLASSIFICATION
// =====================================================================================================
lcSource             = input.source(close, 'Source', group = G_ENTRY)
lcNeighbors          = input.int(8, 'Neighbors Count', minval = 1, maxval = 100, step = 1, group = G_ENTRY)
lcMaxBarsBack        = input.int(2000, 'Max Bars Back', minval = 1, group = G_ENTRY)
lcIncludeFullHistory = input.bool(false, 'Include Full History', group = G_ENTRY)
lcHorizon            = input.int(4, 'Training Label Horizon (bars)', minval = 1, maxval = 50, group = G_ENTRY)
lcSpacing            = input.int(4, 'Neighbor Chronological Spacing (bars)', minval = 2, maxval = 50, group = G_ENTRY)
lcDistQuantile       = input.float(0.75, 'Distance Reset Quantile', minval = 0.0, maxval = 1.0, step = 0.05, group = G_ENTRY)
lcEntryWindow        = input.int(2, 'Entry Signal Window (bars after LC flip)', minval = 0, maxval = 50, group = G_ENTRY)

lcFeatureCount = input.int(5, 'Feature Count', minval = 2, maxval = 5, group = G_ENTRY_F)
lcF1String = input.string('RSI', 'Feature 1', options = ['RSI', 'WT', 'CCI', 'ADX'], inline = '01', group = G_ENTRY_F)
lcF1ParamA = input.int(14, 'Parameter A', inline = '02', group = G_ENTRY_F)
lcF1ParamB = input.int(1, 'Parameter B', inline = '02', group = G_ENTRY_F)
lcF2String = input.string('WT', 'Feature 2', options = ['RSI', 'WT', 'CCI', 'ADX'], inline = '03', group = G_ENTRY_F)
lcF2ParamA = input.int(10, 'Parameter A', inline = '04', group = G_ENTRY_F)
lcF2ParamB = input.int(11, 'Parameter B', inline = '04', group = G_ENTRY_F)
lcF3String = input.string('CCI', 'Feature 3', options = ['RSI', 'WT', 'CCI', 'ADX'], inline = '05', group = G_ENTRY_F)
lcF3ParamA = input.int(20, 'Parameter A', inline = '06', group = G_ENTRY_F)
lcF3ParamB = input.int(1, 'Parameter B', inline = '06', group = G_ENTRY_F)
lcF4String = input.string('ADX', 'Feature 4', options = ['RSI', 'WT', 'CCI', 'ADX'], inline = '07', group = G_ENTRY_F)
lcF4ParamA = input.int(20, 'Parameter A', inline = '08', group = G_ENTRY_F)
lcF4ParamB = input.int(2, 'Parameter B', inline = '08', group = G_ENTRY_F)
lcF5String = input.string('RSI', 'Feature 5', options = ['RSI', 'WT', 'CCI', 'ADX'], inline = '09', group = G_ENTRY_F)
lcF5ParamA = input.int(9, 'Parameter A', inline = '10', group = G_ENTRY_F)
lcF5ParamB = input.int(1, 'Parameter B', inline = '10', group = G_ENTRY_F)

lcUseVolFilter    = input.bool(true, 'Use Volatility Filter', group = G_ENTRY_X)
lcVolMinLen       = input.int(1, 'Volatility Filter Recent ATR Length', minval = 1, group = G_ENTRY_X)
lcVolMaxLen       = input.int(10, 'Volatility Filter Historical ATR Length', minval = 1, group = G_ENTRY_X)
lcUseRegimeFilter = input.bool(true, 'Use Regime Filter', inline = 'regime', group = G_ENTRY_X)
lcRegimeThreshold = input.float(-0.1, 'Threshold', minval = -10, maxval = 10, step = 0.1, inline = 'regime', group = G_ENTRY_X)
lcRegimeSrc       = input.source(ohlc4, 'Regime Filter Source', group = G_ENTRY_X)
lcUseAdxFilter    = input.bool(false, 'Use ADX Filter', inline = 'adx', group = G_ENTRY_X)
lcAdxThreshold    = input.int(20, 'Threshold', minval = 0, maxval = 100, step = 1, inline = 'adx', group = G_ENTRY_X)
lcAdxLen          = input.int(14, 'ADX Filter Length', minval = 1, group = G_ENTRY_X)

type LcFeatureArrays
    array<float> f1
    array<float> f2
    array<float> f3
    array<float> f4
    array<float> f5

type LcFeatureSeries
    float f1
    float f2
    float f3
    float f4
    float f5

lcSeriesFrom(feature_string, _close, _high, _low, _hlc3, f_paramA, f_paramB) =>
    switch feature_string
        'RSI' => ml.n_rsi(_close, f_paramA, f_paramB)
        'WT'  => ml.n_wt(_hlc3, f_paramA, f_paramB)
        'CCI' => ml.n_cci(_close, f_paramA, f_paramB)
        'ADX' => ml.n_adx(_high, _low, _close, f_paramA)

lcLorentzianDistance(int i, int featureCount, LcFeatureSeries fs, LcFeatureArrays fa) =>
    switch featureCount
        5 => math.log(1 + math.abs(fs.f1 - array.get(fa.f1, i))) +
             math.log(1 + math.abs(fs.f2 - array.get(fa.f2, i))) +
             math.log(1 + math.abs(fs.f3 - array.get(fa.f3, i))) +
             math.log(1 + math.abs(fs.f4 - array.get(fa.f4, i))) +
             math.log(1 + math.abs(fs.f5 - array.get(fa.f5, i)))
        4 => math.log(1 + math.abs(fs.f1 - array.get(fa.f1, i))) +
             math.log(1 + math.abs(fs.f2 - array.get(fa.f2, i))) +
             math.log(1 + math.abs(fs.f3 - array.get(fa.f3, i))) +
             math.log(1 + math.abs(fs.f4 - array.get(fa.f4, i)))
        3 => math.log(1 + math.abs(fs.f1 - array.get(fa.f1, i))) +
             math.log(1 + math.abs(fs.f2 - array.get(fa.f2, i))) +
             math.log(1 + math.abs(fs.f3 - array.get(fa.f3, i)))
        2 => math.log(1 + math.abs(fs.f1 - array.get(fa.f1, i))) +
             math.log(1 + math.abs(fs.f2 - array.get(fa.f2, i)))

// LC-internal prediction filters (part of the LC signal definition, as in the source)
bool lcFilterVol    = ml.filter_volatility(lcVolMinLen, lcVolMaxLen, lcUseVolFilter)
bool lcFilterRegime = ml.regime_filter(lcRegimeSrc, lcRegimeThreshold, lcUseRegimeFilter)
bool lcFilterAdx    = ml.filter_adx(lcSource, lcAdxLen, lcAdxThreshold, lcUseAdxFilter)
bool lcFilterAll    = lcFilterVol and lcFilterRegime and lcFilterAdx

// Feature series and storage
lcFeatureSeries = LcFeatureSeries.new(
     lcSeriesFrom(lcF1String, close, high, low, hlc3, lcF1ParamA, lcF1ParamB),
     lcSeriesFrom(lcF2String, close, high, low, hlc3, lcF2ParamA, lcF2ParamB),
     lcSeriesFrom(lcF3String, close, high, low, hlc3, lcF3ParamA, lcF3ParamB),
     lcSeriesFrom(lcF4String, close, high, low, hlc3, lcF4ParamA, lcF4ParamB),
     lcSeriesFrom(lcF5String, close, high, low, hlc3, lcF5ParamA, lcF5ParamB))

var lcF1Array = array.new_float()
var lcF2Array = array.new_float()
var lcF3Array = array.new_float()
var lcF4Array = array.new_float()
var lcF5Array = array.new_float()
array.push(lcF1Array, lcFeatureSeries.f1)
array.push(lcF2Array, lcFeatureSeries.f2)
array.push(lcF3Array, lcFeatureSeries.f3)
array.push(lcF4Array, lcFeatureSeries.f4)
array.push(lcF5Array, lcFeatureSeries.f5)
lcFeatureArrays = LcFeatureArrays.new(lcF1Array, lcF2Array, lcF3Array, lcF4Array, lcF5Array)

// Class labels
int LC_LONG    = 1
int LC_SHORT   = -1
int LC_NEUTRAL = 0

int lcMaxBarsBackIndex = last_bar_index >= lcMaxBarsBack ? last_bar_index - lcMaxBarsBack : 0

// Training labels (label logic ported as-is from the source)
int lcYTrainSeries = lcSource[lcHorizon] < lcSource[0] ? LC_SHORT : lcSource[lcHorizon] > lcSource[0] ? LC_LONG : LC_NEUTRAL
var lcYTrainArray  = array.new_int(0)
var lcPredictions  = array.new_float(0)
var lcDistances    = array.new_float(0)
var float lcPrediction = 0.0
var int lcSignal       = LC_NEUTRAL
array.push(lcYTrainArray, lcYTrainSeries)

// Approximate Nearest Neighbors search with Lorentzian distance
float lcLastDistance = -1.0
int lcSize       = math.min(lcMaxBarsBack - 1, array.size(lcYTrainArray) - 1)
int lcSizeLoop   = math.min(lcMaxBarsBack - 1, lcSize)
int lcStartIndex = lcIncludeFullHistory ? 0 : lcMaxBarsBackIndex

if bar_index >= lcMaxBarsBackIndex
    for i = lcStartIndex to lcSizeLoop
        float d = lcLorentzianDistance(i, lcFeatureCount, lcFeatureSeries, lcFeatureArrays)
        if d >= lcLastDistance and i % lcSpacing != 0
            lcLastDistance := d
            array.push(lcDistances, d)
            array.push(lcPredictions, float(array.get(lcYTrainArray, i)))
            if array.size(lcPredictions) > lcNeighbors
                lcLastDistance := array.get(lcDistances, math.round(lcNeighbors * lcDistQuantile))
                array.shift(lcDistances)
                array.shift(lcPredictions)
    lcPrediction := array.sum(lcPredictions)

// Filtered LC signal state
lcSignal := lcPrediction > 0 and lcFilterAll ? LC_LONG : lcPrediction < 0 and lcFilterAll ? LC_SHORT : nz(lcSignal[1])
bool lcSignalChanged = nz(ta.change(lcSignal)) != 0
bool lcNewBuy        = lcSignal == LC_LONG and lcSignalChanged
bool lcNewSell       = lcSignal == LC_SHORT and lcSignalChanged

// Entry-signal window and one-trade-per-flip bookkeeping
int lcLongFlipBar  = ta.valuewhen(lcNewBuy, bar_index, 0)
int lcShortFlipBar = ta.valuewhen(lcNewSell, bar_index, 0)
var int lcUsedLongFlipBar  = na
var int lcUsedShortFlipBar = na

bool lcLongInWindow  = not na(lcLongFlipBar) and bar_index - lcLongFlipBar <= lcEntryWindow
bool lcShortInWindow = not na(lcShortFlipBar) and bar_index - lcShortFlipBar <= lcEntryWindow
bool lcLongFresh     = na(lcUsedLongFlipBar) or lcLongFlipBar != lcUsedLongFlipBar
bool lcShortFresh    = na(lcUsedShortFlipBar) or lcShortFlipBar != lcUsedShortFlipBar

bool entryLong  = lcSignal == LC_LONG and lcLongInWindow and lcLongFresh
bool entryShort = lcSignal == LC_SHORT and lcShortInWindow and lcShortFresh

// =====================================================================================================
// TIMING | WAVETREND
// =====================================================================================================
wtSrc         = input.source(hlc3, 'Source', group = G_TIMING)
wtN1          = input.int(10, 'Channel Length', minval = 1, group = G_TIMING)
wtN2          = input.int(21, 'Average Length', minval = 1, group = G_TIMING)
wtSigLen      = input.int(4, 'Signal SMA Length', minval = 1, group = G_TIMING)
wtCciConst    = input.float(0.015, 'CCI Scaling Constant', minval = 0.0001, step = 0.001, group = G_TIMING)
wtObLevel1    = input.int(60, 'Over Bought Level 1', group = G_TIMING)
wtObLevel2    = input.int(53, 'Over Bought Level 2', group = G_TIMING)
wtOsLevel1    = input.int(-60, 'Over Sold Level 1', group = G_TIMING)
wtOsLevel2    = input.int(-53, 'Over Sold Level 2', group = G_TIMING)
wtExtLevelSel = input.string('Level 2', 'Overextension Cap Uses', options = ['Level 1', 'Level 2'], group = G_TIMING)
wtTimingMode  = input.string('Recent Cross + Not Overextended', 'Timing Mode', options = ['Recent Cross + Not Overextended', 'Not Overextended Only'], group = G_TIMING)
wtCrossWindow = input.int(5, 'Cross Window (bars)', minval = 0, maxval = 50, group = G_TIMING)

float wtEsa = ta.ema(wtSrc, wtN1)
float wtD   = ta.ema(math.abs(wtSrc - wtEsa), wtN1)
float wtCi  = (wtSrc - wtEsa) / (wtCciConst * wtD)
float wt1   = ta.ema(wtCi, wtN2)
float wt2   = ta.sma(wt1, wtSigLen)

bool wtCrossUp     = ta.crossover(wt1, wt2)
bool wtCrossDn     = ta.crossunder(wt1, wt2)
int  wtBarsSinceUp = ta.barssince(wtCrossUp)
int  wtBarsSinceDn = ta.barssince(wtCrossDn)
float wtObCap      = wtExtLevelSel == 'Level 1' ? wtObLevel1 : wtObLevel2
float wtOsCap      = wtExtLevelSel == 'Level 1' ? wtOsLevel1 : wtOsLevel2

bool wtLongNotExtended  = not na(wt1) and wt1 < wtObCap
bool wtShortNotExtended = not na(wt1) and wt1 > wtOsCap
bool wtLongRecentCross  = not na(wtBarsSinceUp) and wtBarsSinceUp <= wtCrossWindow and wt1 > wt2
bool wtShortRecentCross = not na(wtBarsSinceDn) and wtBarsSinceDn <= wtCrossWindow and wt1 < wt2
bool wtUseCross         = wtTimingMode == 'Recent Cross + Not Overextended'

bool timingLong  = wtLongNotExtended and (not wtUseCross or wtLongRecentCross)
bool timingShort = wtShortNotExtended and (not wtUseCross or wtShortRecentCross)

// =====================================================================================================
// CONFIRMATION | WEIS WAVE VOLUME
// =====================================================================================================
wwvMethod          = input.string('ATR', 'Renko Assignment Method', options = ['ATR', 'Traditional', 'Part of Price'], group = G_CONFIRM)
wwvMethodValue     = input.float(14.0, 'Value', minval = 0, group = G_CONFIRM)
wwvPriceSource     = input.string('Close', 'Price Source', options = ['Close', 'Open / Close', 'High / Low'], group = G_CONFIRM)
wwvUseTrueRange    = input.string('Auto', 'Use True Range instead of Volume', options = ['Always', 'Auto', 'Never'], group = G_CONFIRM)
wwvNormalize       = input.bool(false, 'Normalize', group = G_CONFIRM)
wwvUseVolThreshold = input.bool(false, 'Require Wave Volume Above Its Average', group = G_CONFIRM)
wwvAvgLen          = input.int(20, 'Wave Volume Average Length', minval = 1, group = G_CONFIRM)
wwvAvgMult         = input.float(1.0, 'Wave Volume Average Multiplier', minval = 0.0, step = 0.1, group = G_CONFIRM)

bool  wwvUseClose     = wwvPriceSource == 'Close'
bool  wwvUseOpenClose = wwvPriceSource == 'Open / Close' or wwvUseClose
float wwvVol          = wwvUseTrueRange == 'Always' or wwvUseTrueRange == 'Auto' and na(volume) ? ta.tr : volume
float wwvOp           = wwvUseClose ? close : open
float wwvHi           = wwvUseOpenClose ? (close >= wwvOp ? close : wwvOp) : high
float wwvLo           = wwvUseOpenClose ? (close <= wwvOp ? close : wwvOp) : low

int   wwvAtrLen = math.max(1, math.round(wwvMethodValue))
float wwvAtr    = ta.atr(wwvAtrLen)
float wwvBrick  = wwvMethod == 'ATR' ? wwvAtr : wwvMethod == 'Part of Price' ? close / wwvMethodValue : wwvMethodValue

float wwvCurrClose = na
float wwvPrevClose = nz(wwvCurrClose[1])
float wwvPrevHigh  = wwvPrevClose + wwvBrick
float wwvPrevLow   = wwvPrevClose - wwvBrick
wwvCurrClose := wwvHi > wwvPrevHigh ? wwvHi : wwvLo < wwvPrevLow ? wwvLo : wwvPrevClose

int wwvDirection = na
wwvDirection := wwvCurrClose > wwvPrevClose ? 1 : wwvCurrClose < wwvPrevClose ? -1 : nz(wwvDirection[1])
bool wwvDirChanged = nz(ta.change(wwvDirection)) != 0
bool wwvDirUp      = wwvDirection > 0
bool wwvDirDown    = wwvDirection < 0

int wwvBarCount = 1
wwvBarCount := not wwvDirChanged and wwvNormalize ? nz(wwvBarCount[1]) + wwvBarCount : wwvBarCount
wwvVol      := not wwvDirChanged ? nz(wwvVol[1]) + wwvVol : wwvVol
float wwvRes = wwvBarCount > 1 ? wwvVol / wwvBarCount : wwvVol

float wwvResAvg = ta.sma(wwvRes, wwvAvgLen)
bool  wwvVolOk  = not wwvUseVolThreshold or (not na(wwvResAvg) and wwvRes >= wwvResAvg * wwvAvgMult)

bool confirmLong  = wwvDirUp and wwvVolOk
bool confirmShort = wwvDirDown and wwvVolOk

// =====================================================================================================
// REGIME GATE | SQUEEZE MOMENTUM (non-directional)
// =====================================================================================================
sqzSrc                 = input.source(close, 'Source', group = G_REGIME)
sqzBbLen               = input.int(20, 'BB Length', minval = 1, group = G_REGIME)
sqzBbMult              = input.float(2.0, 'BB MultFactor', minval = 0.1, step = 0.1, group = G_REGIME)
sqzKcLen               = input.int(20, 'KC Length', minval = 1, group = G_REGIME)
sqzKcMult              = input.float(1.5, 'KC MultFactor', minval = 0.1, step = 0.1, group = G_REGIME)
sqzUseTrueRange        = input.bool(true, 'Use TrueRange (KC)', group = G_REGIME)
sqzReplicateQuirk      = input.bool(true, 'Replicate Original BB Width (BB uses KC MultFactor)', group = G_REGIME)
sqzRegimeMode          = input.string('Squeeze Off', 'Regime Condition', options = ['Squeeze Off', 'Not In Squeeze', 'Released Within Window'], group = G_REGIME)
sqzReleaseWindow       = input.int(5, 'Release Window (bars)', minval = 1, maxval = 100, group = G_REGIME)
sqzRequireMomExpansion = input.bool(false, 'Require |Momentum| Expanding', group = G_REGIME)

float sqzBasis   = ta.sma(sqzSrc, sqzBbLen)
float sqzDev     = (sqzReplicateQuirk ? sqzKcMult : sqzBbMult) * ta.stdev(sqzSrc, sqzBbLen)
float sqzUpperBB = sqzBasis + sqzDev
float sqzLowerBB = sqzBasis - sqzDev

float sqzMa      = ta.sma(sqzSrc, sqzKcLen)
float sqzRange   = sqzUseTrueRange ? ta.tr : (high - low)
float sqzRangeMa = ta.sma(sqzRange, sqzKcLen)
float sqzUpperKC = sqzMa + sqzRangeMa * sqzKcMult
float sqzLowerKC = sqzMa - sqzRangeMa * sqzKcMult

bool sqzOn  = sqzLowerBB > sqzLowerKC and sqzUpperBB < sqzUpperKC
bool sqzOff = sqzLowerBB < sqzLowerKC and sqzUpperBB > sqzUpperKC

float sqzVal = ta.linreg(sqzSrc - math.avg(math.avg(ta.highest(high, sqzKcLen), ta.lowest(low, sqzKcLen)), ta.sma(sqzSrc, sqzKcLen)), sqzKcLen, 0)

int  sqzBarsSinceOn   = ta.barssince(sqzOn)
bool sqzFiredRecently = not sqzOn and not na(sqzBarsSinceOn) and sqzBarsSinceOn <= sqzReleaseWindow
bool sqzMomExpanding  = not na(sqzVal) and not na(sqzVal[1]) and math.abs(sqzVal) > math.abs(sqzVal[1])

bool sqzRegimeBase = switch sqzRegimeMode
    'Squeeze Off'            => sqzOff
    'Not In Squeeze'         => not sqzOn
    'Released Within Window' => sqzFiredRecently
    => false

bool regimeGate = sqzRegimeBase and (not sqzRequireMomExpansion or sqzMomExpanding)

// =====================================================================================================
// FINAL ENTRY CONDITIONS
// =====================================================================================================
bool barConfirmed = barstate.isconfirmed

bool longCondition  = barConfirmed and allowLongs and regimeGate and trendLong and entryLong and timingLong and confirmLong
bool shortCondition = barConfirmed and allowShorts and regimeGate and trendShort and entryShort and timingShort and confirmShort

// =====================================================================================================
// EXITS & RISK
// =====================================================================================================
exitMode     = input.string('Either (LC Default)', 'Exit Mode', options = ['LC Signal Flip', 'LC Fixed Hold', 'Either (LC Default)'], group = G_EXIT)
exitHoldBars = input.int(4, 'Fixed Hold (bars from entry signal)', minval = 1, group = G_EXIT)
riskUseSl    = input.bool(true, 'Use ATR Stop-Loss', group = G_EXIT)
riskUseTp    = input.bool(false, 'Use ATR Take-Profit', group = G_EXIT)
riskAtrLen   = input.int(14, 'Risk ATR Length', minval = 1, group = G_EXIT)
riskSlMult   = input.float(2.0, 'Stop-Loss ATR Multiplier', minval = 0.1, step = 0.1, group = G_EXIT)
riskTpMult   = input.float(3.0, 'Take-Profit ATR Multiplier', minval = 0.1, step = 0.1, group = G_EXIT)

float riskAtr = ta.atr(riskAtrLen)

var float longStopLvl  = na
var float longTpLvl    = na
var float shortStopLvl = na
var float shortTpLvl   = na

bool inLong  = strategy.position_size > 0
bool inShort = strategy.position_size < 0

int  lastEntryBar        = strategy.opentrades > 0 ? strategy.opentrades.entry_bar_index(strategy.opentrades - 1) : na
int  barsFromEntrySignal = na(lastEntryBar) ? 0 : bar_index - lastEntryBar + 1
bool holdExpired         = barsFromEntrySignal >= exitHoldBars

bool exitLongRaw = switch exitMode
    'LC Signal Flip' => lcNewSell
    'LC Fixed Hold'  => holdExpired
    => lcNewSell or holdExpired

bool exitShortRaw = switch exitMode
    'LC Signal Flip' => lcNewBuy
    'LC Fixed Hold'  => holdExpired
    => lcNewBuy or holdExpired

bool longExit  = barConfirmed and inLong and exitLongRaw and not shortCondition
bool shortExit = barConfirmed and inShort and exitShortRaw and not longCondition

// ---- Orders
if longCondition
    lcUsedLongFlipBar := lcLongFlipBar
    if not inLong and not na(riskAtr)
        longStopLvl := close - riskAtr * riskSlMult
        longTpLvl   := close + riskAtr * riskTpMult
        strategy.entry('Long', strategy.long, comment = 'Long')

if shortCondition
    lcUsedShortFlipBar := lcShortFlipBar
    if not inShort and not na(riskAtr)
        shortStopLvl := close + riskAtr * riskSlMult
        shortTpLvl   := close - riskAtr * riskTpMult
        strategy.entry('Short', strategy.short, comment = 'Short')

if longExit
    strategy.close('Long', comment = 'LC Exit L')

if shortExit
    strategy.close('Short', comment = 'LC Exit S')

if riskUseSl or riskUseTp
    if (inLong or longCondition) and not na(longStopLvl)
        strategy.exit('Long Risk', from_entry = 'Long', stop = riskUseSl ? longStopLvl : na, limit = riskUseTp ? longTpLvl : na, comment_loss = 'SL L', comment_profit = 'TP L')
    else
        strategy.cancel('Long Risk')
    if (inShort or shortCondition) and not na(shortStopLvl)
        strategy.exit('Short Risk', from_entry = 'Short', stop = riskUseSl ? shortStopLvl : na, limit = riskUseTp ? shortTpLvl : na, comment_loss = 'SL S', comment_profit = 'TP S')
    else
        strategy.cancel('Short Risk')

// =====================================================================================================
// VISUALS & AUDIT (data window)
// =====================================================================================================
color nwColor = nwSlopeUp ? color.new(#00ffaa, 0) : color.new(#ff0000, 0)
plot(nwTrend, 'NW Trend (causal endpoint)', color = nwColor, linewidth = 2)
plotshape(longCondition, title = 'Long Entry', style = shape.triangleup, location = location.belowbar, color = color.new(#009988, 0), size = size.small)
plotshape(shortCondition, title = 'Short Entry', style = shape.triangledown, location = location.abovebar, color = color.new(#CC3311, 0), size = size.small)
plot(inLong and riskUseSl ? longStopLvl : na, 'Long Stop', color = color.new(#CC3311, 30), style = plot.style_linebr)
plot(inShort and riskUseSl ? shortStopLvl : na, 'Short Stop', color = color.new(#CC3311, 30), style = plot.style_linebr)
plot(inLong and riskUseTp ? longTpLvl : na, 'Long Target', color = color.new(#009988, 30), style = plot.style_linebr)
plot(inShort and riskUseTp ? shortTpLvl : na, 'Short Target', color = color.new(#009988, 30), style = plot.style_linebr)

plot(regimeGate ? 1 : 0, 'C1 Regime Gate (SQZ)', display = display.data_window)
plot(trendLong ? 1 : 0, 'C2 Trend Long (NW)', display = display.data_window)
plot(trendShort ? 1 : 0, 'C2 Trend Short (NW)', display = display.data_window)
plot(entryLong ? 1 : 0, 'C3 Entry Long (LC)', display = display.data_window)
plot(entryShort ? 1 : 0, 'C3 Entry Short (LC)', display = display.data_window)
plot(timingLong ? 1 : 0, 'C4 Timing Long (WT)', display = display.data_window)
plot(timingShort ? 1 : 0, 'C4 Timing Short (WT)', display = display.data_window)
plot(confirmLong ? 1 : 0, 'C5 Confirm Long (WWV)', display = display.data_window)
plot(confirmShort ? 1 : 0, 'C5 Confirm Short (WWV)', display = display.data_window)
plot(lcPrediction, 'LC Prediction', display = display.data_window)
plot(lcSignal, 'LC Signal State', display = display.data_window)
plot(wt1, 'WT1', display = display.data_window)
plot(wt2, 'WT2', display = display.data_window)
plot(wwvRes, 'Weis Wave Volume', display = display.data_window)
plot(wwvDirection, 'Weis Wave Direction', display = display.data_window)
plot(sqzVal, 'Squeeze Momentum', display = display.data_window)
plot(sqzOn ? 1 : sqzOff ? -1 : 0, 'Squeeze State (1 on, -1 off, 0 none)', display = display.data_window)
